{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XwQjStLJE71794618956.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國富商馬斯克旗下的SpaceX進行星艦火箭第15次飛行測試，但超重型推進器未能如計劃返回發射場，公司股價在延長交易時段，跌超過百分之1。</p><p></p><p>星艦火箭於美國中部時間下午5時前，由公司得州總部發射升空，這次任務是首次在計劃單一飛行中，同時以發射塔機械臂接住超重型推進器與星艦火箭，但因技術問題，推進器偏離原定返回發射場路線，最終被引導降落至墨西哥灣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:38:20.908368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:39:47.681937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:31:25.718729+00:00","content_hash":"d73be138ca19dfc19408b714b77eeec4b9db9efc1e065cdaf4f9aa2aee7a39c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:38:20.908368+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}